{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-07-18 16:15:00', 'title': 'HYDRO SYSTEMS ADDS E-DOS ELECTRONIC INJECTOR TO LINEUP OF SOLUTIONS FOR THE FARM', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JULY 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HYDRO SYSTEMS, PART OF PSG AND DOVER (NYSE: DOV), RECENTLY EXPANDED ITS LINEUP OF RELIABLE PUMP SOLUTIONS FOR THE FARM WITH THE ADDITION OF THE E-DOS ELECTRONIC INJECTOR.'}